  "remarks": "Former so-called “Minister for Civil Defence, Emergency Situations and Elimination of Consequences of Natural Disasters” of the so-called “Donetsk People’s Republic”. He is a lieutenant general and he is the current Head of the so-called Main Directorate of the Ministry of Emergency Situations, Civil Defense, and the Elimination of Consequences of Natural Disasters of the Russian Federation for the Donetsk People’s Republic. He is a member of United Russia and a member of the Presidium of the Regional Political Council of United Russia of the DNR.",
